    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d47">

                <pb facs="0053" n="39" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg39"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710 Conference W and PW/2–1345: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Chargé in El Salvador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gade</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-02-15T18:00:00-04:00">February 15,
                            1945—6 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>36. Reurtel no. 53, February 13, 11 p.m.<anchor n="79" xml:id="d47-f1"/> Mexico
                    has expressed willingness to recognize Aguirre régime and a circular
                        telegram<anchor n="80" xml:id="d47-f2"/> fixing a date for this action will
                    reach you shortly. Guatemala was adamant in refusing to sit at Conference with
                    delegates accredited by Aguirre régime, even though chosen by Castañeda Castro.
                    In consequence Mexico, which is naturally primarily interested in the success of
                    the Conference, has indicated that it will not invite Aguirre but <pb
                        facs="0054" n="40" xml:id="pg40"/> will intimate to Castañeda Castro
                    informally a willingness to accept his delegates as of March first if and when
                    he takes office. Department feels Mexico will encounter some difficulty in
                    failing to invite the recognized Government of one of the United Nations but
                    considers this primarily a problem for Mexico, as host, to handle.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Guatemala for information only.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
